sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Student
  participant Web as Next.js Web
  participant Api as CertificateController
  participant Service as CertificateService
  participant Learning as LearningService
  participant Repo as CertificateRepository
  participant Notify as NotificationService

  Student->>Web: Open certificate page
  Web->>Api: POST /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/certificate
  Api->>Service: issueIfEligible(studentId, courseId)
  Service->>Learning: Check completion threshold
  Service->>Service: Check required quiz and assignment rules
  Service->>Repo: Create certificate if absent
  Service->>Notify: Notify student
  Service-->>Api: CertificateResponse
  Api-->>Web: 200 OK
  Web-->>Student: Show certificate
